ect","target":"Actividad de reproducción de Jellystat","confidence":"high","reason":"'Actividad de reloj' is a literal mistranslation of 'Watch Activity' (watching media, not a clock). Corrected to 'Actividad de reproducción'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.availabilityLegend","verdict":"correct","target":"Marca de verificación verde: disponible. X roja: no disponible.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Verificación verde' is awkward; 'Marca de verificación' is the standard UI term for a checkmark. 'Rojo X' is grammatically incorrect; 'X roja' is the natural phrasing."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.includedInAlbumRequest","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.noTracks","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.notAvailable","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.runtime","verdict":"correct","target":"Duración","confidence":"high","reason":"'Hora de correr' is a literal mistranslation of 'Runtime' (duration of media). 'Duración' is the correct UI term."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.selection","verdict":"correct","target":"Seleccione elementos para reproducir","confidence":"high","reason":"'Jugar' implies gaming; 'reproducir' is the correct verb for playing media (audio/video)."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.title","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.AlbumTrackList.track","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.DetailDisclosure.pin","verdict":"correct","target":"Fijar {label} abierto en todas las páginas de detalles","confidence":"high","reason":"'Pin' as a verb is better translated as 'Fijar' in this context. 'Abrir a través de' is a literal translation; 'abierto en todas las' conveys the intended state (keeping the section open) more naturally."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.DetailDisclosure.unpin","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.DisclosureOrder.failed","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.